#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:1
msgid "Chongming"
msgstr "崇明区"

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:4
msgid "Ecological technology, smart agriculture and marine systems"
msgstr "生态科技、智慧农业与海洋系统"

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:6
msgid ""
"The 2025-2026 Chongming Park plan supplies current strategic context. The "
"separate 2024 science innovation subsidy measures expired on 31 December "
"2025; we do not present those ceilings as current entitlements."
msgstr "2025至2026年崇明园方案提供战略背景。另一项2024年科技创新资助办法已于2025年12月31日到期，本书不将其额度作为现行权益。"

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S025 "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw12344/20250512/98a1bb8a73c54cb785296ad1835845e1.html>`_. "
"崇明区人民政府关于印发《张江高新区崇明园改革创新发展行动方案（2025-2026年）》的通知."
msgstr "`证据 S025 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw12344/20250512/98a1bb8a73c54cb785296ad1835845e1.html>`_. 崇明区人民政府关于印发《张江高新区崇明园改革创新发展行动方案（2025-2026年）》的通知."

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:10
msgid "Who receives the inquiry"
msgstr "咨询受理"

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:13
msgid "Chongming science and technology authority"
msgstr "崇明区科学技术委员会"

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:15
msgid "`Official district website <https://www.shcm.gov.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`区政府官网 <https://www.shcm.gov.cn/>`_"

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:17
msgid "Published contact: +86 21 69695910."
msgstr "已公布联系电话：+86 21 69695910。"

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:19
msgid "Before applying"
msgstr "申请之前"

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:22
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:24
msgid ""
"Read the dated call and verify district, entity, activity and "
"spending-period rules."
msgstr "阅读带日期通知，核验属地、主体、业务及支出期间。"

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:26
msgid ""
"Prepare the prescribed pack and complete host or district endorsement if "
"required."
msgstr "准备规定材料，按要求完成单位或区级推荐。"

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:28
msgid ""
"Submit through the official platform before the stated deadline and keep "
"the receipt."
msgstr "在截止前通过官方平台提交并保存回执。"

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:30
msgid ""
"Follow review, award, reporting, acceptance and payment obligations in "
"the notice."
msgstr "遵循通知中的评审、立项、报告、验收及拨付义务。"

#: ../../districts/chongming.rst:32
msgid ""
"Ask which current notice governs the project, whether registration and "
"actual operations must both be in the district, which expenditure period "
"is eligible, and whether previous municipal or district awards exclude a "
"claim. Obtain the answer before moving a company or incurring costs."
msgstr "询问适用的现行通知、注册与经营是否均须属地、可计入支出期间，以及已获市区资助是否影响申报。应在迁移企业或发生费用之前获得答复。"

